extends ../baseEmail

block content
  h1 🎉 Congratulations! 🎫
  p #{(payload.customer)? `Hello ${payload.customer.firstName}  ${payload.customer.lastName} `: 'Hello'},
  p We're excited to notify that you received a #{payload.booking.ticket.name} ticket for the event "#{payload.booking.event.name}"

  p
   b Your ticket is attached to this email as a PDF and JPEG file. 📎

  hr
  p Here's what you need to do next:
  ul
    li Show your ticket at the event for a smooth check-in.
    li Keep the QR code on your ticket handy for quick verification.
  p If you have any questions, feel free to reach out to us at #{payload.appEmail}.

  p Thank you for choosing us! We look forward to seeing you at the event. 🥳
  br

  p
    small Best Regards,
    br
    small The #{payload.companyName} Team